{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":146339,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793438688281,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2021,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tpPCim6fdVmj2BrsM7fcC46SfGK.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"3367460","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"In Lake City, a peaceful life is shattered by the resurgence of spiritual energy. After surviving a car accident, high school student Lu Shu unexpectedly awakens an ability: he grows stronger by harvesting \"negative emotion points\" from others. Although his younger sister, Lu Xiaoyu, is mischievous, the two rely on each other for survival. At school, Lu Shu dishes out cynical, snarky remarks to his classmates—garnering a massive amount of negative emotion points in the process—thereby revealing his unique method of leveling up and embarking on an extraordinary adventure in this new era.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-12-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cndzKpSxBG0rINNi85eHcK7YYqp.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cndzKpSxBG0rINNi85eHcK7YYqp.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/146339/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"3367462","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Lü Shu tests his system by deliberately annoying people. He spends his earned system points on a prize wheel, unlocking the \"Fruit of Purification\" and an infamous supernatural \"Stinky Tofu\" item.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-12-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jm8C2JcQwkdW1YhrXKyhhqAxfF1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jm8C2JcQwkdW1YhrXKyhhqAxfF1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/146339/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"3367463","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The world begins acknowledging the \"Aura Awakening.\" The mysterious organization Tian Luo Di Wang establishes special \"Daoyuan Classes\" in schools to train prospective metahumans. Lü Shu joins but hides his true power level.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-12-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":29,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9mMnjNHKtaI2tJMolB2ss01x042.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9mMnjNHKtaI2tJMolB2ss01x042.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/146339/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"3367464","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Lü Shu's classmate, Liu Li, tries to show off his Class-F aptitude. Lü Shu mercilessly trolls him and his classmates to farm distress points, quickly realizing his internal cultivation speed vastly outpaces theirs.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-12-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4WxEYzMr25OE31qvKgsohQKDS8W.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4WxEYzMr25OE31qvKgsohQKDS8W.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/146339/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"3367465","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Lü Shu discovers that his elderly neighbor, Li Xianyi, is actually a legendary Tier-A powerhouse sword cultivator. Xiaoyu charms the old man into teaching her, while Lü Shu observes the techniques to enhance his own mystical celestial map.","language":"en-US"},"a