ulate their fear and frustration to supercharge his system points.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-01-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A1qrRaIk7WjLnEnEboD2gmZzq9C.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A1qrRaIk7WjLnEnEboD2gmZzq9C.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/146339/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"3367469","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Anxious about her brother, Lü Xiaoyu sneaks into the ruins herself. She triggers her own unique awakening: the ability to summon and control the souls of entities Lü Shu or she has defeated.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-01-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":22,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xstPyJ2QhhbMH6DKXxJPOsVYmoO.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xstPyJ2QhhbMH6DKXxJPOsVYmoO.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/146339/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"3367470","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Lü Shu locates the core of the ruins and encounters the massive Skeleton King boss. Using his hidden celestial blade fragments and unmatched physical strength, he battles the beast in secret.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-02-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g51gN9eXoeAFujr0tflx2BB8F8b.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g51gN9eXoeAFujr0tflx2BB8F8b.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/146339/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"3367471","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Lü Shu successfully defeats the boss and absorbs the \"Matrix Eye\"—the magical core controlling the entire ruin. The illusion collapses, and the students are saved, though nobody knows Lü Shu did it.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-02-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":26,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7fHyorrpS2oCEKNpl17dGgX3Tbd.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7fHyorrpS2oCEKNpl17dGgX3Tbd.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/146339/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"3367472","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After returning safely, Lü Shu sells the magical spears back to Tian Luo Di Wang for an exorbitant price. He is officially promoted to a lower management rank within the organisation, securing a stable, wealthy future for Xiaoyu and himself","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-02-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":29,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2IrivXv3PKDaWiwoLLxc1SEiS0n.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2IrivXv3PKDaWiwoLLxc1SEiS0n.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/146339/season/1/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/146339/season/1"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793438688281,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"2":{"checkedAt":1793438688281,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793438688281,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"4":{"checkedAt":1793438688281,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"5":{"checkedAt":1793438688281,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"6":{"checkedAt":1793438688281,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"7":{"checkedAt":1793438688281,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"8":{"checkedAt":1793438688281,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"9":{"checkedAt":1793438688281,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"10":{"checkedAt":1793438688281,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"11":{"checked